# Agent skills, restored with `npx skills add supabase/agent-skills`.
# The content is third-party documentation and the entries under
# .claude/skills are symlinks into it -- which a Windows checkout without
# core.symlinks turns into text files containing a path, leaving the
# skills silently broken. skills-lock.json is committed instead, so the
# versions are pinned and one command restores them per machine.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
